  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR MENA, Management of mixed movements</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNHCR MENA, Management of mixed movements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNHCR&apos;s regional program Strengthening capacities for the management of mixed movement flows and facilitating safe and dignified returns in the Middle East and North Africa region. The support aims to contribute to enhanced capacity to manage migration, strengthened asylum management, and durable solutions for displaced people, including enhanced conditions for return, in accordance with UNHCR&apos;s mandate. The program takes a route-based approach, with activities planned in eight country contexts: Algeria, Egypt, Libya, Morocco, Tunisia, Jordan, Iraq, and Yemen, aiming to cover the main migration routes in the MENA region.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNHCRs regionala program &quot;Strengthening capacities for the
management of mixed movement flows and facilitating safe and dignified returns
in the Middle East and North Africa region&#x201d;. St&#xf6;det syftar till att bidra till st&#xe4;rkt
kapacitet att hantera migration, st&#xe4;rkt asylhantering, h&#xe5;llbara l&#xf6;sningar f&#xf6;r
m&#xe4;nniskor p&#xe5; flykt, inklusive st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande i enlighet med UNHCRs
mandat. Programmet har en ruttbaserad ansats d&#xe4;r verksamhet kommer att ske
i &#xe5;tta landkontexter, Algeriet, Egypten, Libyen, Marocko, Tunisien, Jordanien,
Irak och Jemen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNHCR&apos;s regional program &#x201c;Strengthening capacities for the
